---
layout: base.njk
title: 勇博開講
description: 科技、財經、民生，每天一則新聞，用聽得懂的方式講清楚背後的道理。短影音加文字解讀與資料來源。
permalink: /talk/
---
{%- set counts = collections.talk | catCounts %}
{%- set order = ["科技", "財經", "民生"] %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>勇博開講</h1>
  <p class="lead">科技、財經、民生，每天一則新聞，用聽得懂的方式講清楚背後的道理。</p>
  {%- if counts.length > 1 %}
  <div class="filters" data-filter-group="talkList">
    <button type="button" data-value="" aria-pressed="true">全部 {{ collections.talk.length }}</button>
    {%- for name in order %}{% for c in counts %}{% if c[0] == name %}<button type="button" data-value="{{ c[0] }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c[0] }} {{ c[1] }}</button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
    {%- for c in counts %}{% if c[0] not in order %}<button type="button" data-value="{{ c[0] }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ c[0] }} {{ c[1] }}</button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</section>
{% if collections.talk.length %}
<div class="grid episodes" id="talkList">
  {%- for e in collections.talk %}
  <a class="card" href="{{ e.url }}" data-tag="{{ e.data.category }}">
    {% if e.data.youtube %}<img class="thumb" src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ e.data.youtube }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy">
    {% else %}<div class="thumb"><span>{{ e.data.title | truncate(2, true, "") }}</span></div>{% endif %}
    <div class="body">
      <div class="tags">{% if e.data.draft %}<span class="tag draft">草稿・未發布</span>{% endif %}{% if e.data.category %}<span class="tag">{{ e.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="tag">{{ "影片" if e.data.youtube else "筆記" }}</span><span class="tag">{{ e.date | ymd }}</span></div>
      <h3>{{ e.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ e.data.summary }}</p>
    </div>
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}
<p class="note-disclaimer list-page">財經類內容僅供學習與資訊整理，不構成任何投資建議。</p>
